// ---- Smart AI ([smart_ai]; smart_ai/code/smart_game.cpp, dll/HOOKS.md section "Smart AI").
// One call retarget: the character_sentry_ai reset handler 0x5E7BE0 calls the AI init
// 0x5D4190 (cdecl thread, &out); SmartInitWrap calls it, then gives the enemy a personality. Every member the feature
// reads or writes is proven by the game's own touch(slot) + store pair (SM_SLOT_xx) or reader (SM_RD_*).
